 Kagura Hinata."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c36821"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df0996e39501377ba3905aeb2aa30e951a4bd1a6874ca66301648bde904602f2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/49c9cadf95c2d3b954111234fbdec55d1dd4e02477be8e285752324851ef354d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"成瀬 未亜","creatorId":"vndb:s470","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s470","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s470","name":"成瀬 未亜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:4791","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c36822","characterName":"神楽 ひなた","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c36822"},"originalCharacterName":"神楽 ひなた","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1101"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"145"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hinata is the granddaughter of the village headman, and is one of the rich members of town. She is in Takuma's class and is the council president for her class. She has a kind of obliging personality, and is popular in her school. She is clumsy and tends to fall down, and once she even fell down a flight of stairs at school, though luckily Takuma was there to break her fall. She refers to Takuma as \"Hirose-sama\", a very polite form of expression."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her true name is Kagura Hotaru."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c36822"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f8/f801e6e61757fdb80206aca1b810e99011f6fec0d21a7a39db9d3ffbfe7510a7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c90ffe54a32d6832e60b93ca3178c93f125cce42ed99434f4e8f0db8fca74b26.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一色 ヒカル","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:4788","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c36823","characterName":"田端 ゆい","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c36823"},"originalCharacterName":"田端 ゆい","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1125"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"140"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yui is a girl in Takuma's class. She has a self-aggrandizing personality and always has two male henchmen tagging along. She is very rich and often uses formal speech so as to distinguish herself from the \"commoners\". She is very proud and condescending, but that does not actually mean she is unkind to others. In fact, she gets along quite well with Takuma and the others, with the sole exception of Hayami. She often calls Hayami a \"cockroach\" and along with her henchmen will bully Hayami relentlessly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterI